			},
			"date": "2026-11-16T20:53:55.878Z",
			"content": "<p>My biggest gripe with orgs requiring react right now is that they automatically assume or require client-side routing. If you want to fuck up a single page with react, that's one thing. But fucking up every page with react because you decided to use client-side routing is another level of madness.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
